{#
================================================================================
Table of Contents

The TOC is manifest-driven. It must not infer section visibility from payload
data presence because parent policy owns m5/m10/m11 visibility.
================================================================================
#}

{% set _pages = toc_pages | default({}) %}
{% set _manifest = section_manifest | default({}, true) %}
{% set _toc_sections = _manifest.toc_sections | default([], true) %}
{% set _toc_keys = _toc_sections | map(attribute='key') | list %}
{% set _has_question_detail_toc = 'm9' in _toc_keys %}
{% set _has_english_deep_toc = 'm10' in _toc_keys or 'm11' in _toc_keys %}

<div class="mtoc-page{% if _toc_sections | length > 9 %} mtoc-page--extended{% endif %}">

  <div class="mtoc-title-section">
    <h1 class="mtoc-title">目录</h1>
  </div>

  <ul class="mtoc-list">
    {% for section in _toc_sections %}
    <li class="mtoc-item{% if section.key == 'm8' %} mtoc-item--framepage{% endif %}">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">{{ section.number | default(loop.index) }}</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">{{ section.title }}</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="{{ section.key }}">{{ _pages.get(section.key, '') }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="mtoc-reading-guide">
    <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__title">阅读建议</div>
    <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__items">
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">1</span>
        <span>先看<strong>诊断摘要</strong>了解整体水平，再看<strong>领域达标分析</strong>定位薄弱方向。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">2</span>
        <span>重点关注<strong>核心短板清单</strong>中的高优先级项目，把它们转成下一阶段训练任务。</span>
      </div>
      {% if _has_question_detail_toc %}
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">3</span>
        <span>对照<strong>逐题分析明细</strong>回看错题，确认薄弱环节的具体表现。</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if _has_english_deep_toc %}
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">4</span>
        <span>英语专项页可直接查看<strong>作文精讲</strong>与<strong>阅读精讲</strong>。</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
